<article class="env-lemma" id="00LX">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/00LX">Lemma <span data-tag="00LX">10.72.6</span>.</a> Let $R$ be a local Noetherian ring. Let $0 \to N' \to N \to N'' \to 0$ be a short exact sequence of nonzero finite $R$-modules. </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
$\text{depth}(N) \geq \min \{ \text{depth}(N'), \text{depth}(N'')\} $ 
</p>
</li><li><p>
$\text{depth}(N'') \geq \min \{ \text{depth}(N), \text{depth}(N') - 1\} $ 
</p>
</li><li><p>
$\text{depth}(N') \geq \min \{ \text{depth}(N), \text{depth}(N'') + 1\} $ 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Use the characterization of depth using the Ext groups $\mathop{\mathrm{Ext}}\nolimits ^ i(\kappa , N)$, see Lemma <a href="/tag/00LW" data-tag="00LW">10.72.5</a>, and use the long exact cohomology sequence 
    <p>
      <div class="equation">
  \[  \begin{matrix}  0 \to \mathop{\mathrm{Hom}}\nolimits _ R(\kappa , N') \to \mathop{\mathrm{Hom}}\nolimits _ R(\kappa , N) \to \mathop{\mathrm{Hom}}\nolimits _ R(\kappa , N'') 

\\  \phantom{0\  } \to \mathop{\mathrm{Ext}}\nolimits ^1_ R(\kappa , N') \to \mathop{\mathrm{Ext}}\nolimits ^1_ R(\kappa , N) \to \mathop{\mathrm{Ext}}\nolimits ^1_ R(\kappa , N'') \to \ldots 

\end{matrix}  \]
</div>
    <p>
       from Lemma <a href="/tag/00LU" data-tag="00LU">10.71.6</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>